# Plugins
/Unity/DxMessagingUnity/Assets/Plugins/*

# Ensure Unity package samples are included
!Samples~/
!Samples~/**
# But exclude .rsp files from Samples
Samples~/**/*.rsp
Samples~/**/*.rsp.meta

# The Roslyn source generator's own sources. The trailing ~ keeps Unity from compiling them (they
# target netstandard2.0 and reference Microsoft.CodeAnalysis, which no Unity assembly may see); the
# rule above it, `*~`, would otherwise drop the whole project from the repository.
!Generator~/
!Generator~/**
Generator~/**/bin/**
Generator~/**/obj/**

# The TestU01 stream driver. Same reason as Generator~ one rule up: the trailing ~ is what keeps
# Unity from compiling it, because a `.c` anywhere in this package is native plugin source and
# IL2CPP then fails the standalone player build on includes that only exist next to a TestU01
# checkout. `*~` above would otherwise drop it from the repository entirely.
!scripts/random-quality/testu01~/
!scripts/random-quality/testu01~/**

artifacts*/
artifacts/**
artifacts.meta
